# Terraform state and provider plugins. Nothing here is committed.
#
# State in particular: this configuration is not applied, so there is no state to
# share, and if it ever is applied the state belongs in a GCS backend rather than
# in the repository -- it records resource IDs and can contain values that should
# not be in version control.
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Local variable files. terraform.tfvars would carry the domain and any IP or
# country lists, which are deployment facts rather than code.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!example.tfvars
